        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/koga/{size}/2058_2.png",
        "created_at": "2014-01-11T18:00:00.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>The only Oversized cards that are incorrect are The Dreamer, La Capitan, The Matriarch, and Spite. The Operative's oversized doesn't match the small one either, but the small one targets a \"hero\", while the larger targets a \"hero target\", with the change to hero targets for a lot of cards, they may have just missed it on her small card.</p>",
