        "created_at": "2014-01-11T18:03:39.000Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"little_ernst\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/l/ac8455/48.png\" class=\"avatar\"> little_ernst:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>&nbsp;However, for Mad Bomber Baron Blade and Robotics Factory Omitron, we only own the oversized cards and do not have the little cards to compare to.&nbsp; Are those oversized villain cards correct or do we need to acquire the little villain card versions to play against them?</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>They are just perfect.</p>\n<p>Matriarch's Oversize card isn't quite up to date yet, because Rook City was recently reprinted, thus Errata was added in. Oversized Villain cards won't be updated until the expansion after Vengeance is released.</p>",
